{"shortname": "scrollout", "name": "Scrollout F1", "_id": "504a774abfc09e63304293bb", "url": "https://sourceforge.net/p/scrollout/", "private": false, "short_description": "\u2022 Designed for Linux and Windows email system administrators, Scrollout F1 is an easy to use, already adjusted email firewall (gateway) offering free anti-spam and anti-virus protection aiming to secure existing email servers, old or new, such as Microsoft Exchange, Lotus Domino, Postfix, Exim, Sendmail, Qmail and others.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Built-in multilayer security levels make configuration effort equal to a car radio.\r\n\r\n\u2022 It combines simplicity with effective protection using powerful open source with additional set of rules & filters.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Available as 64bit:\r\n - ISO image (Internet connection required during installation)\r\n - install from scratch (Internet connection required during installation).\r\n\r\n\u2022 Minimum Requirements (for 5,000 messages/day):\r\n1 GB of RAM\r\n30 GB storage drive\r\n1 Processor x86/AMD64\r\n1 Ethernet x 1 IPv4 address\r\nUDP ports: 53 123 4500 6277 24441\r\nTCP ports: 25 80 443 2703", "creation_date": "2010-03-04", "summary": "An easy-to-use anti-spam email gateway", "external_homepage": "http://www.scrolloutf1.com/", "video_url": null, "socialnetworks": [{"accounturl": "ScrolloutF1", "socialnetwork": "Twitter"}, {"accounturl": "https://www.facebook.com/pages/Scrollout-F1-email-gateway/179947158711933", "socialnetwork": "Facebook"}], "status": "active", "moved_to_url": "", "preferred_support_tool": "discussion", "preferred_support_url": "", "developers": [{"username": "mariusegologan", "name": "Marius Gologan", "url": "https://sourceforge.net/u/mariusegologan/"}], "tools": [{"name": "wiki", "mount_point": "wiki", "url": "https://sourceforge.net/p/scrollout/wiki/", "mount_label": "Tutorial", "api_url": "https://sourceforge.net/rest/p/scrollout/wiki/"}, {"name": "discussion", "mount_point": "discussion", "url": "https://sourceforge.net/p